category: Libs
build-depends: cygport gcc-fortran liblapack-devel libmetis-devel libopenmpi-devel libscotch-devel
sdesc: "Distributed memory, MPI based SuperLU (utilities)"
ldesc: "SuperLU_DIST contains a set of subroutines to solve a sparse linear system
A*X=B. It uses Gaussian elimination with static pivoting (GESP). Static
pivoting is a technique that combines the numerical stability of partial
pivoting with the scalability of Cholesky (no pivoting), to run accurately and
efficiently on large numbers of processors."
skip:

homepage: https://github.com/xiaoyeli/superlu_dist
